{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11104020","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11104020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110402001:1":{"text":"守衛さん、戦神峰に行く近道が知りたいんだけど……","source_cn":"守卫大哥，我们想打听通往战神峰的近路……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA70F11DE427CDB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110402002:1":{"text":"ここの裏門から出て向かうのが一番近いですよ。","source_cn":"最近的路，就是从这道残阳武斗场的后门穿过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x215DE711BFDB6EFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1110402002":{"text":"ここの裏門から出て向かうのが一番近いですよ。","source_cn":"最近的路，就是从这道残阳武斗场的后门穿过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x215DE711BFDB6EFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110402003:1":{"text":"申し訳ありません。戦歌祭はババリアの祭典ですから。安全を期すためにも……","source_cn":"抱歉，请诸位理解。战歌节是蛮血的盛事，为了避免治安问题……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBFE295D845D236E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110402004:1":{"text":"正式な開催までは、通行書を持つ方しか通せないのです。","source_cn":"正式开始前，这里只能经由持有文书的人士通行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x245E09B0CF18EE4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110402005:1":{"text":"どうすれば通行書がもらえるの？","source_cn":"我们怎么能拿到文书呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC40BAA52E3AC317","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110402006:1":{"text":"手続きはかなり面倒ですよ。それに資格審査や身分の証明が必要です。","source_cn":"手续很麻烦，而且需要审核资格和验证身份。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86382B99C97EB743","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110402007:1":{"text":"何だって？そんなに待てない。オレたちは急いでるんだ。","source_cn":"什么？可我们必须赶过去，不能延误时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF5F3B1F0F4C9CE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110402008:1":{"text":"なら他の方法を考えるしかありませんね。","source_cn":"那恐怕你们只能另想办法了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08EEDB153D335CBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110402009:1":{"text":"ねえねえ、守衛さん。もしもだけど！お昼ご飯の後にちょっとうたた寝したり、別の場所で見張りをしたりなんてことは……？","source_cn":"那个那个，守卫大哥，打个商量！您在吃午餐的时候，或许可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF6E130CF3DD7D3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110402010:1":{"text":"どういう意味です？それは我らババリア戦士の尊厳に対する冒涜ですよ？","source_cn":"这是什么意思？你是在质疑一个蛮血战士的尊严吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0ED57A2B01116DEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110402011:0":{"text":"……ごめんなさい！でも本当に急いでるんだ！第三の試練に参加しないといけなくて。","source_cn":"……抱歉，但我们真的很想快点赶过去！我们需要参加第三道试炼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C70DD655E0C3E5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110402012:1":{"text":"ああ、試練の参加者でしたか。それでもここは通せませんが、他にも道はありますよ。","source_cn":"参加试炼的勇士吗？虽然还是不能让你们通过，但是你们经过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CA267F913811617","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1110402012":{"text":"ああ、試練の参加者でしたか。それでもここは通せませんが、他にも道はありますよ。","source_cn":"参加试炼的勇士吗？虽然还是不能让你们通过，但是你们经过另一条路，也能按时抵达。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CA267F913811617","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110402013:1":{"text":"武闘場を出たあと、東南の方角へ進んでください。","source_cn":"离开武斗场后，向东南方向进发。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9C9010776D9AB661","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"武闘場を出たあと、東南の方角へ進んでください。","female":"武闘場を出たあと、東南の方角へ進んでください。","variant_male_record_index":"120936","variant_female_record_index":"120937","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110402014:1":{"text":"その方角は……ブラックロアーの縄張りじゃないか！","source_cn":"那个方向？那里是——黑嚎氏族的领地！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F08A0D2FDB4BD18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110402015:1":{"text":"彼らと何かトラブルでも？そうだとしたら確かに厄介ですが……その道が一番早いですよ。","source_cn":"你们有过节？那还真倒霉。但能让你们尽快过去的，只有那条路了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4038F444A721F23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"ぜひ教えてほしい。","source_cn":"请告知我们","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDA8C33CB3A3B9C59","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"ぜひ教えてほしい。","female":"ぜひ教えてほしいわ。","variant_male_record_index":"63202","variant_female_record_index":"63203","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"扉を開けてくれないか？","source_cn":"请开下门","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9DE3CBF26F5074BC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"扉を開けてくれないか？","female":"扉を開けてくれない？","variant_male_record_index":"63198","variant_female_record_index":"63199","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"ここを通してくれないか？","source_cn":"我们可以通行吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x897508116A0B9EEC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"ここを通してくれないか？","female":"ここを通してくれない？","variant_male_record_index":"63200","variant_female_record_index":"63201","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn